== Trivia ==
* {{dlc|r}} The fly will glow slightly in {{Curse|Darkness}}, making its position always visible.
* The name of the item is likely a reference to the maze-solving algorithm called the [[wikipedia:Maze-solving algorithm#Wall follower|left-hand rule]], which is based on walking forward and turning left as far as possible until you find an exit to the maze.

